# Implementation Plan - ICTServe Frontend Mockup Refinement

## Goal Description
Refine the ICTServe frontend mockup ([landing.blade.php](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/resources/views/layouts/landing.blade.php) and [welcome.blade.php](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/resources/views/welcome.blade.php)) to ensure WCAG 2.2 AA accessibility compliance, proper Tailwind configuration, and alignment with MOTAC branding guidelines documented in D12, D13, and D14.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Tailwind Color Configuration**
> I will update [tailwind.config.js](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/tailwind.config.js) to add proper MOTAC color definitions:
> - `primary-600`: `#0056b3` (MOTAC Blue, 6.8:1 contrast ✅)
> - `primary-700`: `#004494` (Hover state)
> - `secondary-600`: `#0B4D8F` (Dark Blue)
> - `success-600`: `#198754` (4.9:1 contrast ✅)
> - `warning-600`: `#ff8c00` (4.5:1 contrast ✅)
> - `danger-600`: `#b50c0c` (8.2:1 contrast ✅)
>
> This will resolve all lint warnings about arbitrary hex values (e.g., `bg-[#0056b3]`).

> [!WARNING]
> **Language Switcher Integration**
> The landing layout currently has a static "BM | EN" language switcher. I will integrate the existing Livewire language switcher component (`<livewire:language-switcher />`) if available, or create a functional Alpine.js version with proper accessibility attributes as documented in D12 §7.4.

