## Proposed Changes

### Configuration

#### [MODIFY] [tailwind.config.js](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/tailwind.config.js)
- Add MOTAC color palette to `theme.extend.colors.primary` (600: #0056b3, 700: #004494)
- Verify existing `success`, `warning`, `danger` colors match documented values
- Ensure `minHeight.44` and `minWidth.44` are defined for WCAG touch targets

---

### Layouts

#### [MODIFY] [resources/views/layouts/landing.blade.php](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/resources/views/layouts/landing.blade.php)
**Changes:**
1. Replace `bg-[#0056b3]` with `bg-primary-600`
2. Replace `text-[#0056b3]` with `text-primary-600`
3. Replace `hover:text-[#0056b3]` with `hover:text-primary-700`
4. Implement responsive hamburger menu with Alpine.js
5. Integrate Language Switcher:
   - Check if `Livewire\LanguageSwitcher` component exists
   - If yes: Replace static switcher with `<livewire:language-switcher />`
   - If no: Create Alpine.js switcher with accessibility (ARIA, keyboard nav)
6. Add ARIA landmarks: `role="banner"` on `<header>`, `role="main"` on `<main>`, `role="contentinfo"` on `<footer>`
7. Update footer copyright to dynamic year: `{{ date('Y') }}`

---

### Views

#### [MODIFY] [resources/views/welcome.blade.php](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/resources/views/welcome.blade.php)
**Changes:**
1. **Hero Section:**
   - Ensure `<h1>` tag for main heading
   - Add `max-w-2xl mx-auto` to subheading
   
2. **Service Cards:**
   - Replace all `text-[#0056b3]` with `text-primary-600` (lines 24, 46, 68)
   - Replace all `bg-[#0056b3]` with `bg-primary-600` (lines 37, 59)
   - Replace all `hover:bg-[#004494]` with `hover:bg-primary-700` (lines 37, 59)
   - Replace all `focus:ring-[#0056b3]` with `focus:ring-primary-600` (lines 37, 59, 81, 85)
   - Replace `focus:border-[#0056b3]` with `focus:border-primary-600` (line 81)
   - Replace `border-[#0056b3]` with `border-primary-600` (line 85)

3. **Semak Status Card:**
   - Verify input has `<label for="ticket_no" class="sr-only">No. Tiket</label>`
   - Ensure input classes include `focus:border-primary-600 focus:ring-primary-600`
   - Ensure button has `border-primary-600 text-primary-600` for outline style

4. **General Accessibility:**
   - Verify all icons have `aria-hidden="true"`
   - Verify all buttons have accessible labels
   - Verify card hover transitions present (`transition-shadow duration-300`)

