## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests

1. **Build Assets:**
   ```bash
   npm run build
   ```
   - ✅ No errors in Vite output
   - ✅ Tailwind classes compiled correctly

2. **Blade Syntax:**
   ```bash
   php artisan view:cache
   ```
   - ✅ No Blade syntax errors

3. **Lighthouse (Chrome DevTools):**
   - Run Lighthouse audit on landing page
   - ✅ Accessibility score ≥90
   - ✅ Performance score ≥80

4. **axe DevTools:**
   - Install axe Chrome extension
   - Scan landing page
   - ✅ Zero violations

### Manual Verification

#### Visual Check
- [ ] **Header:** Deep blue (`#0056b3`) background
- [ ] **Logo:** "MOTAC BPM" visible and aligned
- [ ] **Navigation:** Links visible, hover states work
- [ ] **Language Switcher:** Functional (toggles locale)
- [ ] **Hero:** Heading and subheading legible
- [ ] **Cards:** 3 cards aligned, icons visible, buttons styled correctly
- [ ] **Footer:** Copyright year current, social icons present

#### Accessibility Check
- [ ] **Keyboard Navigation:**
  - Tab through all elements
  - Focus indicators visible (3px outline)
  - No keyboard traps
  - Enter/Space activate buttons

- [ ] **Screen Reader (NVDA/VoiceOver):**
  - Header landmarks announced
  - Card titles announced
  - Button functions announced
  - Input labels announced

- [ ] **Color Contrast (WebAIM):**
  - Primary text on white: ≥4.5:1
  - Button text on primary-600: ≥4.5:1
  - Focus indicator: ≥3:1

- [ ] **Touch Targets:**
  - All buttons ≥44×44px
  - Test on mobile device

#### Responsive Check
- [ ] **Mobile (320px):**
  - Cards stack vertically
  - Navigation collapses to hamburger
  - Footer stacks vertically

- [ ] **Tablet (768px):**
  - Cards display 2 columns
  - Navigation expands
  
- [ ] **Desktop (1024px):**
  - Cards display 3 columns
  - Layout centered with max-width

---

## Success Criteria

- ✅ All lint warnings resolved (no arbitrary hex values)
- ✅ Tailwind config includes MOTAC color palette
- ✅ Language switcher functional with accessibility
- ✅ WCAG 2.2 AA compliant (Lighthouse ≥90, axe zero violations)
- ✅ Responsive on mobile, tablet, desktop
- ✅ Keyboard navigation fully accessible
- ✅ Screen reader compatible
- ✅ Touch targets ≥44×44px
- ✅ Color contrast ≥4.5:1 for text, ≥3:1 for UI components

---

## Notes

- The existing [tailwind.config.js](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/tailwind.config.js) already has `primary`, `secondary`, `success`, `warning`, `danger` color palettes defined.
- **Action:** Verify that `primary-600` matches `#0056b3` (MOTAC Blue). Current config shows `primary-600: #2563eb`, which needs to be updated to `#0056b3`.
- **Language Switcher:** Check [app/Livewire/LanguageSwitcher.php](file:///d:/xampp/htdocs/ictserve-031125/app/Livewire/LanguageSwitcher.php) exists. If not, create Alpine.js version with proper ARIA.
